WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Step 1: Use the compact toolbar for text formatting, safe links and emoji.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Step 2: Open Insert for headings, lists, tables, accordions, quotes and dividers.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Step 3: Choose Media for images, galleries, video/audio, documents or supported video embeds, then check captions.

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Step 4: Use callouts for important information and Undo/redo to review changes before saving or sending.
